          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "सिद्धांत — siddhānt — \"a principle, a theory\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "यह सिद्धांत किताब में अच्छा लगता है। yah siddhānt kitāb meṁ acchā lagtā hai. This theory looks good in a book."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "सिद्धांत (siddhānt) is a tatsama, borrowed from Sanskrit siddhānta, \"an established conclusion\" (Monier-Williams)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
